## Original Content
<p>New AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools to better serve our global community of learners and customers Since our recent closing of the Coursera and Udemy combination, we’ve been focused on one priority: delivering more value for learners, partners, and customers. By bringing together our teams and expertise, we’re able to move faster and [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/accelerating-product-and-platform-innovations-across-coursera-and-udemy/">Accelerating Product and Platform Innovations Across Coursera and Udemy</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Following the merger of Coursera and Udemy, the companies are accelerating product and platform innovations, including AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools. These initiatives aim to deliver enhanced value to learners, partners, and customers globally.

## Key Points
- The recent combination of Coursera and Udemy has been completed.
- New AI-powered experiences are being introduced to enhance learning and engagement.
- Accessibility improvements are a key focus of the innovation strategy.
- Enterprise tools are being developed to better serve organizational customers.
- The goal is to provide more value to learners, partners, and customers through integrated efforts.


